+, 38.66025, 5.0, 0.0
$ CID 3 — LEFT wing spline axis (mirror): y_hat = (-0.5, -0.866, 0) root->tip -y
CORD2R, 3, 0, 30.0, 0.0, 0.0, 30.0, 0.0, 10.0
+, 21.33975, 5.0, 0.0
