$ member lying on the symmetry plane. The full-span mirror must carry BOTH
$ wings on the physical (2x) fuselage, exactly as the centreline CONM2 masses
$ were doubled. With 2x: q=40 trim matches NASTRAN Listing 7-2 to 5 digits
$ (ANGLEA 0.16918 vs 1.6919E-1) and all six restrained columns are <=0.61%.
$ Recovery points kept geometric (stress recovery approximate for the 2x
