$ ============================================================
$ TRIM CARDS — q=40 (SC1) and q=1200 (SC2), both M=0.9, 1g (URDD3=-32.174)
$ RHOREF (sbeam extension, Step 61) is the freestream density: it plays no part
$ in the static trim and exists only so V = sqrt(2q/rho) is available to the
$ transient maneuver rate terms.  2.3769-3 slug/ft^3 = sea-level standard day.
$ ============================================================
TRIM, 1, 0.9, 40.0, RHOREF, 2.3769-3, PITCH, 0.0
+, URDD3, -32.174, URDD5, 0.0
TRIM, 2, 0.9, 1200.0, RHOREF, 2.3769-3, PITCH, 0.0
+, URDD3, -32.174, URDD5, 0.0
